  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> be the probability of successes and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> be the probability of failure.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>gives <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For having at least <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;successes in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;trials,</p><p>Required probability<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>6.2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>256</mn><mn>729</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
